Package: kubeos-containerd
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, containerd.io, kubeos-pause-image
Description: KubeOS: containerd configuration for a Kubernetes node
 Generates /etc/containerd/config.toml from `containerd config default` and patches the two
 values a Kubernetes node needs: the systemd cgroup driver, and the sandbox (pause) image
 known to the release.
 .
 The file is generated rather than shipped because containerd.io's own conffile disables the
 CRI plugin and carries no `imports` line, so a drop-in cannot fix it; generating also means
 the settings always match the containerd that is actually installed. The unit runs before
 containerd at every boot and rewrites the file only when it differs, so an upgrade of
 containerd.io cannot leave a node that is no longer a Kubernetes node.
 . 
 It then reports nothing and does nothing when the node is already correct.
